# Settlement Radio — Licence

Copyright (c) 2026 Settlement Radio. All rights reserved except as stated below.

> **Replace "Settlement Radio" above with the copyright holder's legal name or entity before the
> legal review** (ARCHITECTURE.md §35 step 15). This file implements the intent recorded as content
> item **C10** and `DECISIONS.md` **D-032**. It is written by a non-lawyer from public sources and is
> **not legal advice**; it is in scope for that review.

This repository contains two kinds of material under two different sets of terms. **The default is
"all rights reserved."** Only the paths named in Part 2 are open-source licensed.

---

## Part 1 — Creative content: ALL RIGHTS RESERVED

This covers everything in the repository that is not named in Part 2, and in particular:

| Path | What it is |
|---|---|
| `canon/` | the world bible — the settings, history, peoples, institutions and facts of the fiction |
| `core/` | the station's identity and premise |
| `cast/` | presenter cards and speech profiles |
| `voices/` | voice reference clips |
| `music/` | catalogue manifests and the recordings they describe |
| `docs/` | design and editorial documentation |
| `prompts/` | prompt templates, which encode the creative direction |

**No licence is granted** to copy, publish, distribute, adapt, translate, perform, broadcast, train
machine-learning models on, or make derivative works from this material, in whole or in part, by any
means, without prior written permission from the copyright holder.

This repository is public so that the project can be read and its methods learned from. **Public
visibility is not a licence.** GitHub's Terms of Service grant users of that platform the right to
view and fork this repository; nothing beyond that is granted here, and forking conveys no right to
use the content.

The names, places, characters, institutions, events and other original elements of the fictional
setting are the copyright holder's. The setting is an original work written as a tribute to
twentieth-century science fiction and is not derived from, endorsed by, or affiliated with any
existing author, work, franchise or rightsholder.

**Permission requests:** open an issue on this repository.

